{
  "name": "@shgroup/dsh-serenity-hooks",
  "version": "1.113.1",
  "description": "宁静号 ACC harness（Native Cordis 插件）——给 DeepSeek Harness 装一个「AI 工作区」：12 个工具（container_fs/cognitive_trajectory/dashboard/container_git/msm/praxis/ontology/serenity-skill-creator/localstore/container_admin；另两个 im-bridge/diagram 按配置条件出现）+ 机械约束（安全模式/工作区围墙/密钥守卫/对外输出守卫）+ 认知轨迹日志与原地重建 + 网页登录入口/IM 桥/认知轨迹唤醒注册表。轨迹声明 = 轨迹目录下的 trajectory.json（约束面 + 旧标识 uid + CRO 机器绑定 cro.host；旧名 trajectory-constraint.json / skiff.json 仍在读取族里）；轨迹提示词 = 轨迹目录下的 PROMPT.md（一条轨迹「是谁、按什么章程工作」，所有轨迹通用，追加在容器层与质量层之后，不替换它们）。适配 DSH 0.1.7-rc.1 / 0.2.0-rc.1 / 0.2.1-rc.1（三档）。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/tellmewhattodo/dsh-serenity-plugin.git"
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "lib/client.js",
    "lib/invariant.js",
